<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiya Gɩkpa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Gɩkpa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Hakaliya wobi Nehemiya wanyun-gyebi n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Duwi dɩkɩ, Kisilefi wobon anɩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kisilefi wù di Babilon bete boobon yɛkɩfɛ, gɛtɛ gengyi à ka a ba nfan fɔ, ebon ɛtɔkɔ ɛ̀ sa ebon fwo-ɛkɩfɛ ma ebon fwo-ɛnyɔɔfɛ boo getite.</char></note> fɔ, Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ gɩkyan dikpilinfɛ gaanɩ, gɛtɛ nmɩ Nehemiya ǹ sa ditele-dɩrɛ Susa daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani gɛtɛ è di mɩɩndɩrɛ ɛbɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ fɔ, ma bɛnɩ bɛkɩ be ye Yuda bɛ ba, gɛ na lila bɛ Yuda bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be kuruma ben gye bɛ da gisela fɔ boo koro. Gɛ na biri na lila bɛ na dama Yerusalem ditele dii koro.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Yuda bete gɛtɛ be kuruma, gɛ be biri bɛ ba fɔ, bɛ̀ sa dɩyɩyɛ-dɩrɛ ma ɩnɩnfa-dɩrɛ yaanɩ. Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ wu sila wʋ nʋ̀n, gɛ ditele fɔ dɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ i kpin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Gɛtɛ na nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, na waran na sara, gɛ na wula, gɛ na sara dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ awi kpekpesi. Na ban onyun, gɛ na tiri onyun na tɛ Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Gɛ na dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 1:5">&lt;&lt;Oo! Yahwe, gatala gii Wurubwarɛ, Wurubwarɛ-kpatakpɩrɩ, aade ɩ̀ ba gɩsaa. Aa di aa gelen gii dikola dii koro, aa len ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee di aa-ise yii koro fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Ken giten maakʋn gepepe, fɔ àà tirima bʋnʋn nya mɩ, fɔ àà nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan gɛtɛ ǹ te tiri onyun n kpèlè wɔ̀ odòn ma ofilibon n tɛ aa bɛnɩ, Isareli bete lɛ maakʋn. Ǹ te tiri ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛtɩ Isareli bete, fɩya ma nmɩ, ma miinte dɩkpaara tɩ mɛ wɔ̀ fɔ n dɔ̀. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Tɩ mɛ wɔ̀ duyu-kɛma daade. Tin di aa-ise, ma aade-wùlàlɛ, ma aade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ aasaranyan Mose fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Oo Wurubwarɛ, kʋna aanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a tɛ Mose alan, &lt;Gengyi in di nʋnkwarɩ fɔ, nan yasɩ yɩ n sa bɩfɩɩ-bɩfɩɩ baanɩ, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />mɔ gengyi ì biri ɩ ba maakʋn, gɛ ì di mii-ise yii koro fɔ, yɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ yasɩ, gɛ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ da gisela sɩyɛɛ ɔfɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gii getenkʋn gba fɔ, nan biri n kʋla bɛ n ye dʋkɔ, fɔ nan birima bɛ n ba ɔkʋn gɛtɛ na tiri gɛtɛ wàà mɛ mɩɩn gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ.&gt;<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Yema bè di gɛ aa bɛsʋmalɛ ma aa bɛnɩ gɛtɛ a ka aakɛma-dɩrɛ, ma aa gʋlɔ-dɩrɛ a to bɛ a ya. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Oo Efonte, nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan miinyun-tiri. Nʋn aa bɛsʋmalɛ gɛtɛ bè serenti wɔ̀ lɛ boonyun-tiri. Yɛ ade yàà san gepe tɛ nmɩ aasaranyan ǹdò fɔ ete nyawɔ èè we miin gutunkoro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, nmɩ Nehemiya n di egyu wɔ bʋkan bʋʋyaranlɛ.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya ɛ san Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ, Nisan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nisan è di ebon-gyangbasɛlɛ Yuda bete bɔɔ gɩkyan gaanɩ. Ɛ sa gɛ Kirisito bete bɔɔ gɩkyan giibon-siyeefɛ ma ɛnaafɛ boo getite.</char></note> wobon anɩ, egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi gɩkyan dikpilinfɛ gaanɩ, gɛtɛ bɛ ka bʋkan bɛ mɔma egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ, na ka bʋkan fɔ na san ma wɔ. Fɔ en te we mɩ nan bɔnkyɔn n nya. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Okoro egyu fɔ e lila mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a bɔnkyɔn gɛlɛ gɛtɛ an taa yeba mɔ? Nyawʋ bɩrɛ wù di gɛ ade ɩkɩ n tɛ ha wɔ̀ aaturu waanɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Dʋkɔ fɔ, wʋ mɛ mɩ gɩsaa wʋ kààrà. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Gɛ na dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, sara nkpa gakpaakpa! Na bɔnkyɔn yema ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ be lò tiitu ɛbɛ daanɩ fɔ di di gbena, gɛ ɔtan wu kuma-kuma dɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lila mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ aa len nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Gɛ na tiri onyun na tɛ Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala fɔ, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />gɛ na tiri wuunyun na tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, gengyi à len, gɛ gengyi maade ii di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn fɔ, tɛ mɩ osele nan san Yuda, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ be lò miintu ɛbɛ fɔ, fɔ nan ma biri n sere ditele fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lila mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Awi alen gɛ aà ma sara dʋkɔ, gɛ duwiri gɛ aà biri a ba?&gt;&gt; Fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔsɔ è si wakʋn. Egyu è len gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɛ mɩ osele nan san, okoro na tɛ wɔ awi gɛtɛ nan ma di dʋkɔ.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Gɛ na biri na dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, gengyi wù di aa gelenbi fɔ, yɛ bàà ŋwara akpa bɛ tɛ mɩ gɛtɛ nan ka n ma tɛ Efrati Getu-fèn giisele wʋʋ bɛnyalɛ, fɔ bàà tɛ mɩ osele nan ma gyu Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Nte koturu wɔ̀ ke alɛ, yɛ bàà ŋwara gɩkpa tɛ Asafu gɛtɛ è di egyu gɩkan gɩɩnyalɛ fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɛ mɩ iyon nan ka n ma salɩ ɩpʋnʋ n sa dikwo-tɔlɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ gbɛma Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ, ma dɩkpaara gɛtɛ nan sara daanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ fɩya ma nmɩ okoro, egyu-dɩrɛ e yera maade gɛtɛ na lila fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Gɛ e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ bɛkɩ ɛ fɩya ma nmɩ, gɛ na san na ma gyu Efrati Getu-fèn, gɛ na ka egyu-dɩrɛ wakpa fɔ na tɛ osele wʋʋ bɛnyalɛ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Gɛtɛ Horon-te Sanibalati, ma Amon-te Tobiya bɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, wʋ ha gɛtɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ ba ɛ̀ bɛ mɛ gepe ɛ tɛ Isareli bete.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya e silin ɛ nya Yerusalem wɔ-ɩpɔrɩ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Okoro na ma gyu Yerusalem, gɛ na sara dʋkɔ awi asiyee. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Gɛ na tɔ odente ma beteni-kalansɛ bɛkɩ. Fɔ mɩn dɔ̀ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ade gɛtɛ miin Wurubwarɛ ɛ ka ɛ sa miinturu waanɩ alɛ n mɛ n tɛ Yerusalem. Fɔ ɛnan gɛtɛ bɛɛ sara wo koro ɛkɩ ɛn ma dʋkɔ, dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ gɛtɛ na sara dii koro na san fɔ diiko.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Na tɔ odente gɛ na ye ma otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dɩtagba Diitunu fɔ, ka san Egbongbon Wɔlɔkɔ wɔpɩ, ka ma gyu otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ditonton Diitunu fɔ wʋʋpɩ. Na nya Yerusalem wo-itunu gɛtɛ i sila-sila ɩ nʋ̀n fɔ gepepe, ma wɔ-ɩpʋnʋ gɛtɛ ɔtan wu muru fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Gɛ na san na ma ye Ditiribun Diitunu wʋʋpɩ, ka ma gyu Egyu-dɩrɛ-Dɩbʋna dɩɩpɩ. Mɔ osele wʋkɩ wʋn ma gɛtɛ mɩɩn dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dàà gyu ye. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Okoro na bʋn ma dɩtagba fɔ odente-odente wʋtɔkɔ, gɛ na nya ɔpɔrɩ fɔ gepepe, gɛ na biri gama na ma gyu ma Dɩtagba Diitunu fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Fɔ ditele dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nyɩnla ɔkʋn gɛtɛ na da, abɛɛ ade gɛtɛ ǹ tɛ mɛ. Yema ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, mɩn tɛ dɔ̀ Yuda bete, abɛɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, abɛɛ gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ, abɛɛ bɛndɩrɛbi, abɛɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ ade ɩkɩ.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Gɛ na bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya dɩfana gɛtɛ ti gyu daanɩ. Yerusalem e gbena, gɛ wɔ-ɩpʋnʋ i kpin. Ɩ yɛ taà biri tɩ mara Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ, fɔ tàà ye ɩnɩnfa-dɩrɛ nyayɩ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Na nɩ dɔ̀ bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ miin Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ sa ma nmɩ, ma anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ mɩ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà kya ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gebiri-sere!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ kya gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Horon-te Sanibalati, ma wɔsaranyan Amon-te Tobiya, ma Arabi-te Gesem bɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, bɛ mʋmwa, gɛ bɛ sa tɩ dɩkpàtà. Gɛ be lila tɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaade gɛ ɩɩ mɛ lɛ? Ii len yàà tɔ yela egyu-dɩrɛ wo koro?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Gɛ na tiri wuunyun na tɛ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala fɔ ɛɛ̀ yɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gàà san gepe tɛ tɩ. Ɛtɩ Wurubwarɛ bɛsaranyan taà biri tɩ kya gesere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ. Mɔ ɛyɩ bɩrɛ ɩn ma gedikʋn gɩkɩ Yerusalem, gɛ ɩn ma otimi wʋkɩ Yerusalem, gɛ akukuba-de ɩkɩ ɩn ma gɛtɛ baà ka bɛ kʋna yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu beserelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Eliyasibi, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ-do fɔ na pɩna Bɛyɛran Bootunu fɔ na sere. Bɛ ka wʋ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ, gɛ bɛ sa wʋʋ-ɩpʋnʋ. Bɛ ka ɔpɔrɩ fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ ka ma ye abansʋrʋ Akpilin-ton wɔpɩ, ka ma gyu Abansʋrʋ Hananeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Yeriko beteni be sere ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ, gɛ Imiri wobi-teni Sakuri na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma Yeriko beteni booyo fɔ e sere.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Gɛ Hasenaa bebi-teni be sere otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Ɛsʋ̀n Wotunu fɔ. Bɛ sa wʋʋ gatala giitunu-yon-fon, gɛ be sere itunu-yon-fon, gɛ bɛ sa wʋʋ-ɩpʋnʋ, ma otunu waawɔrɔnyan, ma wawɔrɔnyan-tanlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Uriya wobi Meremoti gɛtɛ wotu n di Akosi fɔ na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Wɔ gama fɔ Berekiya wobi Mesulam, gɛtɛ wotu n di Mesesabeli mɔ na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Gɛ Baana wobi Sadoki mɔ ɛ pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Tekowa bete na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Mɔ boo ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba gingyebi fɔ, bɛn warama koro tɛ bɔɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Paseya wobi Yoyada ma Besodeya wobi Mesulam bɛ pɩna Otunu-kuba fɔ. Be sere itunu-yon, gɛ bɛ sa yɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ, ma otunu waawɔrɔnyan, ma waawɔrɔnyan-tanlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Gibeyon ma Misipa bete, ma Gibeyon-te Melatiya, ma Meronoti-te Yadon na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Atele nyayɩ ɩ̀ sa Efrati Getu-fèn gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ bɔɔ gatɩn. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Haraya wobi Usiyeli, gɛtɛ è di sɩka-sɩya gʋtʋn gɩɩmɛlɛ fɔ na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Gɛ Hananiya gɛtɛ ɛɛ mɛ lafɩnta fɔ na pɩna ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wù tɛrɛma fɔ. Bɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ bɛ ma sere ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ɔpɔrɩ ma Otin fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Huri wobi Refaya gɛtɛ è di Yerusalem wɔlanlanbi wʋʋfan wʋkɩ wuugyegeyelɛ fɔ mɔ na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Arumafi wobi Yedaya mɔ ɛ pɩna ɔkʋn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa wɔ dɩkpaara diifèn-do fɔ. Gɛ Asabineya wobi Atusi ɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Harim wobi Malikiya, ma Pahati-Mowabi wobi Hasubi bɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn wʋkɩ, ma dikwo-tɔlɛ gɛtɛ bee kuma boroboro daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Halohesi wobi Salum, gɛtɛ è di Yerusalem wɔlanlanbi wʋʋfan fɔ wuugyegeyelɛ fɔ bebi-nanɩ bɛ kpà wɔ, gɛ bɛ pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanun ma Sanowa bete na pɩna Dɩtagba Diitunu fɔ. Bɛ pɩna wʋ be sere, gɛ bɛ sa wʋʋ-ɩpʋnʋ, ma waawɔrɔnyan, ma waawɔrɔnyan-tanlɛ fɔ. Gɛ bɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ gɛtɛ waabo wʋ̀ ba bemeta nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (450) ma sere Ditonton Diitunu wʋʋpɩ.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Rekabi wobi Malikiya, gɛtɛ è di Beti-Akerem wɔlanlanbi wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ na pɩna Ditonton Diitunu fɔ. E biri sere wʋ, gɛ ɛ sa wʋʋ-ɩpʋnʋ, ma waawɔrɔnyan, ma waawɔrɔnyan-tanlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Koli-Hose wobi Salum, gɛtɛ è di Misipa wɔlanlanbi wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ na pɩna Ditiribun Diitunu fɔ. Ɛ pɩna wʋ e sere, gɛ e tin wʋ, gɛ ɛ sa wʋʋ-ɩpʋnʋ, ma waawɔrɔnyan, ma waawɔrɔnyan-tanlɛ fɔ. E biri ɛ pɩna Silowam Ditiribun dɩɩpɔrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaarabi fɔ ma sere akyikya-warankʋn gɛtɛ ɩ waran ɩ ma ye ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Asibuki wobi Nehemiya, gɛtɛ è di Beti-Suri wɔlanlanbi wʋʋfan wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ na pɩna ɛ ma sere Dafidi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɔɔ bɩsàn buufen-do, ka ma ye butu buu geyelakʋn gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Lefi bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Bani wobi Remu gatɩn fɔ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. Gbɛma wɔ fɔ, Asabiya gɛtɛ è di Keyila wɔlanlanbi wʋʋfan wʋkɩ wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wɔlanlanbi boo diyere daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Wɔ gama fɔ, gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Henadadi wobi Bafayi gɛtɛ è di Keyila dikpi ɔfan-nyɔɔfɛ wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ gatɩn fɔ na pɩna. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Wɔ gama fɔ, Yesuwa wobi Eseri, gɛtɛ è di Misipa ditele dɩɩnyalɛ fɔ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ ye wʋʋ gɩbʋnlɛ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa akpanyan yɩɩ gɛsɩkʋn giifèn-do fɔ ma sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ kɔna anɩ. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Wɔ gama fɔ, Sabayi wobi Baruki na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ, ye ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ kɔna anɩ ma sere gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Eliyasibi dɩkpaara diitunu. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Wɔ gama fɔ, Uriya wobi Meremoti gɛtɛ è di Akosi wɔnana fɔ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ ye Eliyasibi dɩkpaara diitunu ma sere dɩkpaara fɔ dii getenkʋn.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, ɩlanlan gɛtɛ i silin Yerusalem i tuma fɔ yii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Bɔɔ gama fɔ, Benyamin ma Hasubi na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa bɔɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bʋnʋn-bʋnʋn fɔ. Bɔɔ gama fɔ, Maaseya wobi Asariya, gɛtɛ è di Ananiya wɔnana fɔ na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ gɩlan fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Wɔ gama fɔ, Henadadi wobi Binuwi na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ ka wu ye Asariya dɩkpaara ma sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ kɔna anɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Usayi wobi Palali na pɩna e ye ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ kɔna anɩ ka ma sere dikwo-tɔlɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa digyu-kpaara dɩɩpɩ, gbɛma bɛdɩyɛlɛ bɔɔ dɩkpaara fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Gɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè si Ofeli wodonbi wuu koro fɔ mɔ bɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ bɛ ma sere ɔkankɩ gɛtɛ wù di Butu Buutunu wuufèn-do gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan ma dikwo-tɔlɛ dɩɩpɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Bɔɔ gama fɔ, Tekowa bete na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wu ye dikwo-tɔlɛ fɔ dɩɩpɩ fɔ, ka ma sere Ofeli Wɔpɔrɩ wʋʋpɩ.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ na pɩna Dibengyi Diitunu gatala wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ. Ɛkamasɛ ɛ pɩna wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bʋnʋn-bʋnʋn. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Bɔɔ gama fɔ, Imeri wobi Sadoki na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa wɔ dɩkpaara diifèn-do fɔ. Wɔ gama fɔ, Sekaniya wobi Semaya, gɛtɛ è di ɛdɩyɛlɛ Ofila wʋʋ Gɛtàkʋn Wuutunu fɔ mɔ ɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Wɔ gama fɔ, Selemiya wobi Ananiya, ma Salafi wobi-kooronfɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Hanun fɔ mɔ na pɩna ofèn wʋkɩ. Bɔɔ gama fɔ, Berekiya wobi Mesulam na pɩna ofèn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa wɔ dɩkpaara diifèn-do fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Malikiya gɛtɛ è di sɩka-sɩya gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ fɔ na pɩna e ye Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ ma gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ɔbalan gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɛnɩ baade yaanɩ fɔ wuufèn-do fɔ, ka ma ye gatala gii dikwo gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ kɔna anɩ fɔ dɩɩpɩ. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Sɩka-sɩya gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ ma gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ fɔ na pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuufèn-kurumakyɛɛ. Wʋ ka wu ye gatala gii dikwo dɩɩ kɔna fɔ wʋʋpɩ ka ma sere Bɛyɛran Bootunu wʋʋpɩ.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya e di ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be len bàà mɩna wɔ gʋtʋn fɔ boo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Gɛtɛ Sanibalati ɛ nʋn alɛ ti biri tɩɩ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ fɔ ti sere fɔ, ɛ ka owurufa gepepe, gɛ ɛ mʋmwa tɩ. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè yela wɔ gama, ma Samariya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ Yuda bete nyabɛ gɛtɛ baade ɩ̀ ba gutunkoro lɛ bɛɛ mɛ lɛ? Baà biri be sere bɔɔpɔrɩ fɔ? Baà tɛ gedi? Ǹdò gɛ baà were? Baà talɩ be puligi ataa-kpinlɛ gɛtɛ ɩ kʋla ɩ̀ dɔ anlɛ ditonton lɛ be birima be sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Gɛ Amon-te Tobiya gɛtɛ è yela wɔ gama fɔ mɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aan! Ɔpɔrɩ gɛ bee sere lɛ? Gengyi egbongbon gba ɛ̀ bʋn wuu koro fɔ, eè sila gɛlɛ gaataa yɩɩpɔrɩ nyawʋ ɛ fɩna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo tii Wurubwarɛ, nʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mʋmwa tɩ bɛ sa dɩkpata! Yɛ boo getoro gɛtɛ bee toro tɩ lɛ gàà biri baayu yii koro. Yɛ bɛkyʋnlɛ bàà bè gye bɛ san gisele anlɛ anyan gɛtɛ be kpila bɩtà baanɩ bɛ da. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Kara tin bɔɔ dɩpwɛ dii koro, gɛ kara ka baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ, yema bɛ kɔkɔ atuyorobi be lù ɛtɩ beserelɛ fɔ bɛ sa wɔ̀ owurufa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Okoro tɩ kyaga ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gɛpɩna-sere, gɛ wʋ tɔ wʋ nɩma wukukuba fɔ wʋʋfan, yema gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka booturu powu bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Sanibalati, ma Tobiya, ma Arabi bete, ma Amon bete, ma Asidodi bete bɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Yerusalem wɔ-ɩpɔrɩ wʋʋ gɛpɩna fɔ gɩ san bʋnʋn, gɛ asila-nʋ̀nkʋn fɔ ɩ sʋ fɔ, bɛ ka owurufa bɛ kààrà. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Okoro ɛbɛ powu bɛ mɛ onyun gɛtɛ baà bɛ̀ tà Yerusalem bɩtà, fɔ bàà ka gesugiti ba. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ti tiri onyun tɩ tɛ tii Wurubwarɛ, gɛ tɩ sɩ̀ bɛnɩ-dɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ dɩyɛ odòn ma ofilibon.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Mɔ Yuda bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bɔɔkɛma wʋʋ yɔlɔ. Gɛ anyan-kpɛtɛlɛ fɔ mɔ ɩ̀ dɔ kpekpesi, gɛtɛ tɩn nan talɩ tɩ pɩna ti sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Gɛ tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ mɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Pɛ bàà we nyɩnla, abɛɛ bàà we tɩ fɔ, ti were be gyu boo getite, tii wolo bɛ, fɔ bɔɔ gʋtʋn fɔ gi ten dʋkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Gɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bè si gbɛma bɛ fɔ, bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ tɩ disere dilen-dilen alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baà ye ɩkʋn kperen-kperen bɛ bɛ tà tɩ bɩtà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Okoro na ka bɛnɩ-dɩyɛlɛ na ma yela ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gama, ɩkʋn gɛtɛ bɛn tɛ mara were fɔ. Na sɩ̀ bɛ afʋrɩ-afʋrɩ, gɛ bè de bɛtata, ma buturunyan, ma bɛgyangarɩ. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Gɛtɛ na nya ade yaanɩ fɔ, na we gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ boo koro gɩɩ gbɛrɛ bɛ. Okoro na tɔ na yela, gɛ na dɔ̀ bengyebi fɔ, ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara serenti bɛ! Ɩ kʋna gɛtɛ Efonte ɛ̀ sɔ, gɛ wade ɩ̀ ba gɩsaa, fɔ yàà kpà tɛ yɩɩdɩrɛ ɛbɛ, ma yii bebi-teni, ma yii bebi-nanɩ, ma yɩɩsɔ ɛbɛ, ma yaakpaara!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Gɛtɛ tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɛ nʋn alɛ tɩ nyɩnla amɩnlɛ-kpen gɛtɛ bɛ ka tii koro, gɛ bɛ nyɩnla alɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ mɩna yɩ fɔ, ɛtɩ powu ti biri tɩ ba ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋpɩɩ, gɛ ɛkamasɛ e biri e gyu wɔ gʋtʋn gaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ ka san fɔ, mɩɩn bɛnɩ fɔ ɔfan na yɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ, gɛ ɔfan mɔ bè de buturunyan, ma awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro, ma bɛgyangarɩ, ma bɩtà bʋʋ gɛgba. Gɛ bɛndɩrɛbi be yela Yuda bete fɔ powu bɔɔ gama kin-kin <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere gaade yaanɩ. Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee tola anyan bɛ bɛ tɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gɛmara fɔ bɛɛ ka gɛ gʋlɔ-kɩlɩn bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn, fɔ bè de akpanyan mɔ gʋlɔ-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Gɛ bɛmaralɛ fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ ɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ, wɔ tata ɛ̀ ban wɔ gɛtɩɩ. Mɔ dɩkantan dɩɩfʋ̀nlɛ fɔ bɩrɛ ee yela ma nmɩ.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Gɛ na dɔ̀ bengyebi fɔ, ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gʋtʋn fɔ gʋsɔ, gɛ gɩ̀ yɛrɛ gɩ̀ dɔ gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ ti ye ɔfɔ ma bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Okoro gengyi ɩ̀ nʋn dɩkantan dɩɩ gɛfʋn fɔ, i serenti ɩ ba taakʋn! Tii Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ kpà ɛ tɛ tɩ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Okoro tɩ bɔ tɩ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ, gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ ɔfan fɔ be ton buturu-nyan ye ofila wʋʋ gɛtà ma sere ofila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀n. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Waanɩ fɔ, na biri na dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ alɛ, wù di gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ma wɔsaranyan bàà sara Yerusalem odente, fɔ wàà yɛ gɛtɛ bàà dɩyɛ ditele fɔ odente, fɔ bàà mɛ gʋtʋn ofila-kenken. <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Nmɩ oo, mɩɩndɩrɛ ɛbɛ oo, mɩɩn bɛnɩ oo, bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ oo, taanɩ ɛkɩ en tiri wɔ ngba sɩ̀ nya. Gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ ɛ̀ ma kpà butu gba fɔ, è de wakpanyan.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya ɛ kpà beyen-welɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Wʋ bɛ ba gɛtɛ beteni ma bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ be gyu gɛtʋrʋn bɔɔ bɛnɩ Yuda bete fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Bɛkɩ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛtɩ ma tii bebi-tenibi ma bɛnanɩbi tɩ̀ sɔ. Wù di gɛtɛ tàà wura afɩnaa, fɔ taà wura anyandilɛ ti di, fɔ taà wura nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Bedo bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ ka tii-ili yɩɩ ntʋnkwaa, ma tɩɩ wayɩn wo-ili, ma taakpaara tɩ sɩ̀ awʋba pɛgɛ ti wura afɩnaa dɩkpan dɩɩya nyawʋ waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Gɛ bedo mɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ lwa gɛ sɩka gba tɩ ka ti le tɩɩ ntʋnkwaa ma tɩɩ wayɩn wo-ili yii gutoro tɩ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Nkele, ma gɛtɛ ɛtɩ ma ɛbɛ tì di gɛ nkalan-kɩlɩn gba, gɛ tii bebi mɔ bè we anlɛ ɛbɛ mɔ booyo ɛbɛ gba fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ tàà ka tii bebi tɩ mɛ bɛdɩ̀. Tɩɩ bebi-nanɩbi bɛkɩ gba be were gyu gɩdɩ̀ gaanɩ, mɔ tɩn ma ɔkɛma wʋkɩ, yema tii-ili yɩɩ ntʋnkwaa, ma tɩɩ wayɩn wo-ili i biligi bɛkɩ booyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Gɛtɛ na nʋn bɔɔ gɛtʋrʋn, ma baade-tùlɛ nyayɩ fɔ, na ka owurufa na kààrà. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Gɛtɛ na sa amɩnlɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ yii koro na were fɔ, na tin bengyebi fɔ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ dɩpwɛ, gɛ na dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nyɩ ɛyɩ gbagba yɩɩ bɛnɩ alɛ be le butu bɛ gyaga anyan-lwalɛ fɔ yii koro!&gt;&gt; Okoro na kpèlè getuma-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ nan ka n tabʋrʋ gɛlɛ gaade fɔ, <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />gɛ na dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ sa aniya ti to tɩɩ bɛnɩ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɩfɩɩ-fon bʋ se fɔ ti ye baakʋn. Gɛ nkele ɛyɩ ii fu yɩɩ bɛnɩ ɩ tɛ tɩ tàà biri ti se!&gt;&gt; Gɛ be tin boo-inyun, yema ben we ade gɛtɛ baà dɔ̀.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Gɛ na dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ ɩɩ mɛ lɛ ɩɩn kɔlɔ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ in serenti Wurubwarɛ, fɔ tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ bɛ kara wura osele wʋkɩ bɛ mʋmwa tɩ? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Nmɩ, ma mɩɩn bɛnɩ, ma mɩɩn bɛsaranyan mɔ tɩɩ lwa bɛnɩ fɔ kɔba ma anyandilɛ de! Ɩ yɛ tàà kere butu bʋʋ gɛgyaga baade fɔ tɩ ya! <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />I birima bɔɔ ntʋnkwaa, ma bɔɔ wayɩn wo-ili, ma boo-ilife yii-ili, ma baakpaara, ma butu gɛtɛ ɩ gyaga baanyan-lwalɛ yii koro fɔ, ma anyan yaabi, ma wayɩn-fon, ma bʋnɔ fɔ ɩ tɛ bɛ bilenten!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Gɛ bengyebi fɔ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Taà birima baanyan tɩ tɛ bɛ, gɛ tɩn nan ni lila gɩnyankɩ ti ye baakʋn. Taà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Gɛ na kpèlè gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ na tuma, gɛ na yɛ bengyebi ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ kan ntam alɛ baà di ade gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ sɩ̀ fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Nmɩ mɔ ke na kpʋkpa ayanbi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kyaga ma mɩɩn gɛgba fɔ, gɛ na dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ en di ade-dɔ̀lɛ-sɩ̀lɛ nyayɩ yii koro fɔ, anlɛ gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ kpʋkpa wɔ dɩkpaara ma wanyan gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba fɔ. Wurubwarɛ ɛ kpʋkpa gɛlɛ gɩɩnɩ ɛtɔkɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara alɔ-kwaa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu be yera alan, &lt;&lt;Wàà ba gɛlɛ! Gɛ be sila Yahwe.&gt;&gt; Gɛ be di baade gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ sɩ̀ fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Nkele mɔ, ye egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi gɩkyan dikpilinfɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ka mɩ bɛ sɩ̀ Yuda gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ ma sere gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-nyɔɔfɛ, gɛtɛ wù di mɩɩn gɩkyan fwo gɩnyɔɔfɛ fɔ, nmɩ oo, mɩɩndɩrɛ ɛbɛ oo, taanɩ ɛkɩ en di anyandilɛ gɛtɛ be yo bɛ tɛ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Mɔ Gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sara pɛgɛ na sara fɔ, ɛ ka ditola-dɩrɛ e tola gɩfɩɩ fɔ. Bee to sɩka-fututu wabi akpilin anyɔɔ (40), fɩya ma anyandilɛ ma bʋkan be ye bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn. Bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi gba bee di bɛnɩ fɔ boo koro. Mɔ Wurubwarɛ geserenti gii koro, nmɩ bɩrɛ mɩn mɛ gɛlɛ. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Mɔ fɔ, na ka koro na tɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gebiri-sere. Mɩɩn bɛnɩ fɔ powu be tuma dʋkɔ bɛɛ mɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gʋtʋn. Gɛ tin gye gɛtʋnkwaa gɩkɩ sɩ̀ tɛ koro.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wù biri wʋ fɩya fɔ, na tɛ Yuda bete ma bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (150) anyandilɛ, fɩya ma bendeni gɛtɛ be ye bɩfɩɩ-bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ bu silin tɩ bu tuma, gɛ bɛ ba taakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Ɛkwɔ-teni ɛkɩ, ma bɛyɛran ma ayo, ma bɛkɔrɔkɔ gɛ bɛɛ ka be kpele anyandilɛ mɩɩn dɩkpaara daanɩ duwi-kamasɛ. Gɛ awi fwo-kamasɛ fɔ, n te se bʋkan kperen-kperen kpekpesi. Ma nyayɩ powu gba fɔ, min lila anyandilɛ gɛtɛ bee yo bɛ tɛ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ fɔ gba, yema na we gɛtɛ ditola-dɩrɛ dɩ̀ gyaga bɛnɩ fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Oo miin Wurubwarɛ, hira mɩ maade-kpara powu gɛtɛ na mɛ na tɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ lɛ yii koro.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gebiri-tɔ-yela Nehemiya wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanibalati, ma Tobiya, ma Arabi-te Gesem, ma tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ nʋn gɛtɛ na biri na sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ, gɛ difwe dɩkɩ din kuruma. Wu kuruma gɛ ɩpʋnʋ gɛtɛ nan sa itunu fɔ yiiko. <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Gɛ Sanibalati ma Gesem bɛ sa mɩ ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà tuma atele gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Ono wɔtalɩ waanɩ fɔ yɩɩ dɩkɩ daanɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:2">Mɔ fɔ bɛ mɛ gɛ onyun gɛtɛ bàà mɛ mɩ ade-kpen. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na sa bɛnɩ baakʋn alɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gʋtʋn gɩ da mɩ alɔ, okoro mɩn nan talɩ n ba. Lan gɛ nan kere gʋtʋn n ya fɔ nan tɔ n ba yaakʋn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Bɛ sa mɩ ɔtʋn-kɩlɩn fɔ disere dɩnaa, gɛ ɔya-kamasɛ fɔ, ade-kɩlɩn fɔ gɛ ǹ bɔ n tɛ dɔ̀ bɛ.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Disere-tonfɛ fɔ, Sanibalati ɛ sa wɔsaranyan alɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ ɔtʋn-kɩlɩn fɔ. Fɔ ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa gɛtɛ ɛn tan giinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alɛ ɛ ka ɛ bɛ̀ tɛ mɩ. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 6:6">&lt;&lt;Tɩɩ nʋn ti ye bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ bu silin yɩ bu tuma fɔ baakʋn alɛ ɛyɩ ma Yuda bete ɩɩ sa amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ yàà tɔ yela gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ boo koro. Okoro gɛ i biri ɩɩ mara ɔpɔrɩ fɔ. Gesem ke ɛ dɔ̀ ade fɔ na nʋn. Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ n di alɛ awɔ n te len àà mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ a tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Gɛ alɛ a were len Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ bàà yasɩ aade nyayɩ Yerusalem gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ alɛ, &lt;Egyu ɛ̀ sa Yuda!&gt; N te to n di gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ̀ nʋn gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ, okoro ba fɔ taà ka amɩnlɛ ade fɔ yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Gɛ na tiri wuunyun na tɩyɛma wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ aa dɔ̀ lɛ yaanɩ wʋkɩ wʋn ma waanɩ. Awɔ gbagba n tɛ salɩ yɩ a sa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Bɛɛ sa tɩ gɛ gɩsaa gɛtɛ koro gàà yɔ tɩ, fɔ tɩ kara talɩ ti werema gʋtʋn fɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:9">Mɔ na tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Wurubwarɛ, sa mɩ ɔkɛma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Duwi dɩkɩ na tɔ na san Delaya wobi Semaya gɛtɛ è di Meetabeli wɔnana fɔ wakʋn nan ma silin wɔ. Fɔ bɛn taa tɛ wɔ osele gɛtɛ èè ye wɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ taà ma tuma Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara, Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn, tàà ma bu dʋkɔ, fɔ taà tan dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ, yema bɛnɩ bee len bàà bè wolo wɔ̀. Baà bè wolo wɔ̀ odente.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Mɔ na dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Fɔ eteni anlɛ nmɩ lɛ nan serenti? Nmɩ nyawɔ nan ma bu Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ alɛ n te to koro nkpa? Mɩn nan san!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Na we na nyɩnla gɛtɛ nka Wurubwarɛ na sa wɔ, mɔ ɛ tabʋrʋ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ yema Tobiya ma Sanibalati na hayɩ wɔ. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Bɛ hayɩ wɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gɛlɛ, fɔ gɩsaa gàà ton mɩ, fɔ nan wura n gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ, fɔ bàà wura sa miin diyere dɩdɩɩ bàà ka bɛ sa mɩ ɩnɩnfa.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Gɛ na tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo miin Wurubwarɛ, ade gɛtɛ Tobiya ma Sanibalati bɛ mɛ lɛ yii koro, kara finla gɛtɛ àà tiira bɛ giten. Tiira Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-nanɩ Nowadiya ma bɛtabʋrʋlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ be len bàà yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton mɩ fɔ giten.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere-werema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Okoro be sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ be were Eluli wobon duwi dikpilin ma tonfɛ (25) daanɩ. Gʋtʋn fɔ powu gi to awi akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo-anyɔɔ (52). <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Gɛtɛ tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ powu bɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ bu silin tɩ bu tuma fɔ bu gyu gɩsaa, gɛ ɩnɩnfa i gye bʋ, yema be we bɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ na kpà tɩ, gɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gi were.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ powu waanɩ fɔ, Yuda bengyebi ma Tobiya bɛ̀ bɔ bɛɛ ŋwara akpa bɛ tɩyɛma bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Fɔ Yuda bɛnɩ kpekpesi bè yela Tobiya gama, yema wolote n di Arahi wobi-teni Sekaniya. Gɛ wobi Yehohanan e to Berekiya wobi-teni Mesulam wobi-nanɩ gɩna. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Bɛnɩ bee tì bè sila wɔ bɛ tɛ mɩ, fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ n tɛ dɔ̀ ka da ma wo koro fɔ. Gɛ Tobiya gba ɛɛ tɩ̀ ŋwara akpa ɛ tɩyɛma mɩ fɔ wàà sa mɩ gɩsaa.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Gɛtɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gɛpɩna-sere wu were fɔ, na sa ɩpʋnʋ, gɛ na ka otunu wʋʋ bɛnyalɛ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ ma Lefi bete na sa bʋʋ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Na ka Yerusalem ditele dɩɩ gɛnya na sa mɩɩndɩrɛ Hanani ma Hananiya, gɛtɛ è di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔndɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ-dɩrɛ wuu koro fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ. Hananiya è di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba nʋnkwarɩ, yema è serenti Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ wʋn ma dɩkʋsʋ. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Gɛ na dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ tɩ̀ kara tana Yerusalem wɔ-ɩpʋnʋ fɔ ka ma sere gɛtɛ ofila wàà bʋn pɛ. Gɛ gengyi otunu wʋʋ bɛnyalɛ bè yela bɛɛ dɩyɛ gba fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ bàà tan itunu fɔ ma awɔrɔnyan. Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ àà tiri Yerusalem bete bàà mɛ bɛdɩyɛlɛ. Bɛkɩ baà mɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ, fɔ bedo mɔ bàà dɩyɛ ɛbɛ gbagba baakpaara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ bɛ ba fɔ baayere</para>
  <para style="r">Esira 2:1-70</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Fɔ Yerusalem ditele fɔ dɩ̀ yɛrɛ dɩ dɔ, mɔ bɛnɩ bɛɛn sɔ daanɩ, gɛ ben te biri sere akwo kpekpesi. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ miin Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ miinturu waanɩ alɛ n kpèlè bengyebi, ma bɛndɛrɛbi, ma ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ n tuma, fɔ bàà ŋwara ayere akpaara-akpaara. Na we ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye gisela bɛ ba dɩgyangbasɛ fɔ boo gewo-tama giidu gɩɩ gɩkpa. Bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gaanɩ alan,<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be biri bɛ ba bɔɔlɛ Yerusalem, ma Yuda gɛtɛ nafɔ Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa e gye bɩtà ɛ da wɔlɛ fɔ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ (be biri bɛ ba Yerusalem ma Yuda, ɛkamasɛ ɛ san wo ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Boo begyegeyelɛ n di Serubabeli, ma Yesuwa, ma Nehemiya, ma Asariya, ma Raamiya, ma Nahamani, ma Moridekayi, ma Bilisan, ma Misipereti, ma Bigifayi, ma Nehum, ma Baana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Isareli bɛnɩ bɛkɩ mɔ gɛtɛ be ye dʋkɔ bɛ ba fɔ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Parosi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gbaa ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (2,172).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Sefatiya wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (372).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Arahi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (652).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Pahati-Mowabi gɛtɛ e ye Yesuwa ma Yowabi bɔɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gbaa ma nkpɩn bɩnaa ma fwo nɩyɛ (2,818).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elam wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnaa (1,254).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Satu wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (845).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Sakayi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin nɩyɛ (760).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Binuwi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma nɩyɛ (648).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebayi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma dikpilin ma nɩyɛ (628).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Asigadi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gbaa ma gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron ma bɛnyɔɔ (2,322).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adonikam wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin asiyee ma kwarankɩ (667).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigifayi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gbaa ma akpilin asiyee ma kwarankɩ (2,067).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adin wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo-ton (655).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Ateri (gɛtɛ e ye Esekiya dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ) wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin anaa ma fwo-nɩyɛ (98).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hasum wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (328).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Besayi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron ma bɛnaa (324).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Harifu wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin ton ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (112).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Gibeyon wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin anaa ma fwo ton (95).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:25" />
        <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Betelem ma Netofa boo beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin yɛkɩ ma nɩyɛ (188).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anatoti beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (128).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Beti-Asimafeti beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (42).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Kiriyati-Yarim, ma Kefira, ma Beeroti boo beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma besiyee (743).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Rama ma Geba baatele yii beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma dikpilin ma ɛkɩ (621).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Mikimasi ditele dii beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin kooron ma bɛnyɔɔ (122).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Beteli ma Ayi baatele yii beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin kooron ma besiyee (123).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Nebo-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (52).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Elam-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnaa (1,254).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Harim beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron (320).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Yeriko ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma ton (345).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Lodi ditele, ma Hadidi ditele, ma Ono ditele yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron ma ɛkɩ (721).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Senaa ditele dii beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gbaa ma nkpɩn yɛkɩ ma akpilin kooron ma fwo (3,930).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:38">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:38" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:39" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yedaya gɛtɛ e ye Yesuwa wodu waanɩ fɔ dɩkpaara dii beteni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo besiyee (973).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Imeri dɩkpaara dii beteni bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn ton ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (1,052).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Pasuri dɩkpaara dii beteni bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma kwarankɩ (1,247).</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Harim dɩkpaara dii beteni bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn ton ma fwo kwarankɩ (1,017).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:42">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:42" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Lefi bete n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yesuwa ma Kadimiyeli gɛtɛ be ye Hodafiya wodu waanɩ fɔ boo bebi-teni bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin asiyee ma fwo bɛnaa (74).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:43" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">be ye Asafi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ baanɩ. Bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin kwarankɩ ma nɩyɛ (148).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:44">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:44" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:45" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Bè di Salum, ma Ateri, ma Talimon, ma Akubi, ma Hatita, ma Sobayi boo-idu yɩɩ bɛnɩ.</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   Bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">akpilin kooron ma fwo-nɩyɛ (138).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:45">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:45" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:46" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Idu-idu fɔ n di</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   Siha dɩkpaara, ma Hasufa dɩkpaara, ma Tabawoti dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />ma Kerosi dɩkpaara, ma Siya dɩkpaara, ma Padon dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />ma Lebana dɩkpaara, ma Agaba dɩkpaara, ma Salimayi dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />ma Hanan dɩkpaara, ma Gideli dɩkpaara, ma Gahari dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />ma Rehaya dɩkpaara, ma Resin dɩkpaara, ma Nekoda dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />ma Gasam dɩkpaara, ma Usa dɩkpaara, ma Paseya dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />ma Besayi dɩkpaara, ma Mewunim dɩkpaara, ma Nefusesim dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />ma Bakibuki dɩkpaara, ma Akufa dɩkpaara, ma Haruri dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />ma Basiluti dɩkpaara, ma Mehida dɩkpaara, ma Harisa dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />ma Barikosi dɩkpaara, ma Sisera dɩkpaara, ma Tema dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />ma Nesiya dɩkpaara, ma Atifa dɩkpaara.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:56">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:56" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Solomon bɛsaranyan boo-idu yɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be biri bɛ ba Yuda fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:57" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Idu-idu fɔ yɩɩ bɛnɩ n di</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   Sotayi dɩkpaara, ma Sofereti dɩkpaara, ma Perida dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />ma Yaala dɩkpaara, ma Darikon dɩkpaara, ma Gideli dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />ma Sefatiya dɩkpaara, ma Hatili dɩkpaara,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   ma Pokereti-Asebami dɩkpaara, ma Amon dɩkpaara.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:59">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:59" />
  </para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Dikwo-Dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ ma Solomon bɛsaranyan boo-idu yɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">gɛkpɩn ma akpilin yɛkɩ ma fwo-bɛnyɔɔ (392).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:60">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:60" />
  </para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baayere ɩɩ ba lɛ be ye Teli-Mela, ma Teli-Harisa, ma Kerubi, ma Adon, ma Imeri. Mɔ fɔ bɛn talɩ wùlà alɛ bɔɔ dɩkpaara di ye Isareli wodu waanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Ɛbɛ n di</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   Delaya, ma Tobiya, ma Nekoda boo-idu yɩɩ bɛnɩ. Bɛ̀ ba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (642).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:62">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:62" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ baanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">idu-idu fɔ n di</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Hobaya, ma Hakosi ma Barisilayi gɛtɛ e to Barisilayi gɛtɛ e ye Gileyadi fɔ dɩkpaara diibi-nanɩbi ɛkɩ gɩna, gɛ ɛ ka wɔsɔ fɔ dɩkpaara dii diyere fɔ.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="pi1" vid="NEH 7:63">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:63" />
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Gɛtɛ be bugiti baayere gɛ ben we akpaara gɛtɛ yaanɩ be ye okoro, be tiri bɛ be ye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩɩ gʋtʋn gaanɩ, yema bè we anlɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ boo koro gɩ̀ ba dɩdɩɩ. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Okoro gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ ɛ sʋ bɛ alɛ bɛn nan wura be di anyan-dilɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛkɩ ɛɛ̀ da ma Wurim ma Tumim ɛbɛ boo koro e we ade fɔ yaanɩ pɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Dikpi fɔ powu dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ asepekyi anyɔɔ ma gbaa ɛkɩ ma gɛkpɩn ma akpilin nɩyɛ (42,360), <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />gɛtɛ bɛn kalan bɔɔ bɛsʋmalɛ-teni ma bɔɔ bɛsʋmalɛ-nanɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin kooron ma fwo kwarankɩ (7,337) fɩya. Gɛ bɛ̀ nɩ̀ ba ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ-teni ma bɛnanɩ gɛtɛ baasɔ ɩ̀ ba gɛkpɩn ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (245). <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Baabengyi ɩ̀ ba nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron ma fwo kooron (736). Baakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɩ̀ ba gɛkpɩn ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (245), <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />ma akpɔŋɔ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma dikpilin ma fwo ton (435), ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron (6,720).<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Akpaara ɩkɩ yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ bɛ tɛ anyan gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ gaanɩ. Gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ ɛ tɛ sɩka-sɩya bekilo nɩyɛ ma ɔfan, bɛtasabi akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50), ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ ngba nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin kooron ma fwo (530). <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Akpaara fɔ yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ bɛkɩ bɛ tɛ sɩka-sɩya bekilo akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo (170), ma sɩka-fututu nkpɩn kooron (1,200). <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Anyan powu gɛtɛ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ tɛ fɔ n di sɩka-sɩya bekilo akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo (170), ma sɩka-fututu bekilo nkpɩn ton ma akpilin ton (1,100), ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ ngba akpilin asiyee ma kwarankɩ (67)<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ma Lefi bete fɔ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ, fɩya ma bɛnɩ fɔ bɛkɩ, ma Isareli bete-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ ma sara baatele yaanɩ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 7:73">Esira ɛ kalan Ose fɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Gɛtɛ ebon-kwarankɩfɛ ɛ nɩma fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ wɛrɛ sara baatele yaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Bɛnɩ fɔ powu be tuma anlɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn, dɩkpaara gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Butu Buutunu wʋʋpɩ fɔ daanɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ ɛŋwaralɛ Esira alɛ ɛ ka Mose Wose wʋʋ Gɩkpa gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ ŋwara ɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ ɛ ba.<verse eid="NEH 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Okoro ebon-kwarankɩfɛ wo duwi-gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Esira ɛ ka Ose wʋʋ Gɩkpa fɔ ɛ ba bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn. Beteni, ma bɛnanɩ, ma bebi powu gɛtɛ baà talɩ bɛ nʋn ade yaanɩ fɔ be tuma dʋkɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />E yela dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ, Otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Butu Buutunu fɔ wʋʋ bʋnʋn ɛ kalan Ose fɔ ye gagyɩgyan ma sere ofila-kenken beteni, ma bɛnanɩ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà talɩ bɛ nʋn ade yaanɩ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be ken aten gepepe bɛɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ Ose wʋʋ Gɩkpa fɔ gɩɩ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ewùlàlɛ Esira ɛ ma yela omini-tɔlɛ wʋkɩ gɛtɛ bɛ ka iyon bɛ gbɛrɛ tɛ gɛlɛ gaade ɩtɔkɔ duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ wuu koro. Matitiya, ma Sema, ma Anaya, ma Uriya, ma Hilikiya ma Maaseya bè yela wologyi-lɔ. Gɛ Pedaya, ma Misayeli, ma Malikiya, ma Hasum, ma Hasibadana, ma Sekariya, ma Mesulam mɔ bè yela wɔ dɩbɩyan-lɔ.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Esira e tirima gɩkpa fɔ gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ ee we wɔ, yema ɛwɔ è yela gatala da ɛbɛ powu. Gɛtɛ e tirima gɩkpa fɔ, bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan fɔ powu bɛ tɔ be yela. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esira e sila Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ-kpatakpɩrɩ fɔ. Gɛ bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan fɔ powu bɛ bʋma baalɔ gatala, gɛ be yera alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ ba gɛlɛ! Wʋ ba gɛlɛ!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ waran be kura, gɛ bɛ ka bʋnʋn be tin gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ e yela wo geyelakʋn, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ Yesuwa, ma Bani, ma Serebiya, ma Yamin, ma Akubi, ma Sabetayi, ma Hodiya, ma Maaseya, ma Kelita, ma Asariya, ma Yosabadi, ma Hanan, ma Pelaya be tiri Ose fɔ waanɩ bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Bɛ kalan Wurubwarɛ Wose fɔ be ye gɩkpa gaanɩ, gɛ be biri be tiri waanɩ gepepe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛ ŋwara gɛ Ose fɔ Hebere ginde gaanɩ. Mɔ gɛtɛ Yuda bete fɔ bɛ sara Babilon, gɛ bɛ yɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ Aram ginde bɔɔ gɛtabʋrʋ kpekpesi gaanɩ okoro, wu hiyan gɛtɛ bàà tiri Ose fɔ waanɩ tɛ bɛ Aram ginde gaanɩ.</char></note>, gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bàà wura nʋn waanɩ gepe.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ Nehemiya, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Esira, ma Lefi bete gɛtɛ bee wùlà bɛnɩ fɔ ade fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Duwi nyadɩ dì di fɩrɩnfɩrɩn tɛ Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Ɩ kara tʋrʋn, gɛ ɩ kara wula.&gt;&gt; Yema ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ nʋn Ose fɔ waade-dɔ̀lɛ fɔ, be gyu gewula. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Nehemiya ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sa bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san fɔ yàà ma len anyandilɛ-kpara i di, fɔ yàà nyʋn wayɩn bʋkan ma ɔsɛ, fɔ yàà tɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ ben kpele gɩnyankɩ fɔ. Duwi nyadɩ dì di gɛ Tiifonte duwi-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Ɩ kara bɔnkyɔn, yema ɔsɛ gɛtɛ ii wura i ye Yahwe wakʋn fɔ n di yɩɩkɛma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Lefi bete fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ sa bɛnɩ fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kʋn, yema duwi nyadɩ dì di duwi-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Ɩ kara sara dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ da, gɛ bɛ ma di gɛ bɛ nyʋn, gɛ bɛ tɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ ben kpele fɔ, gɛ be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ. Yema bɛ nʋn anyʋn-gyebi gɛtɛ be tiri be wùlà bɛ fɔ yaanɩ gepepe.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Ebon fɔ duwi-nyɔɔfɛ daanɩ fɔ, akpaara-akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɛ ma tuma ewùlàlɛ Esira wakʋn gɛtɛ bàà kasɩ Ose fɔ waade-wùlàlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be we Ose gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dama Mose wo koro ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ waanɩ gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ Isareli bete bàà tɔ bɛ san bɛ ma sara ɩpanpan yaanɩ, ɩpanpan yɩɩsɛ wuu gedi wuu duwi fɔ daanɩ, ebon kwarankɩfɛ wanɩ, ɔya gɛtɛ bee di ɩpanpan yaawi fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dɩsʋma. 23:37-40</char></note>Fɔ bàà dɔ̀, fɔ bàà yasɩ atele yaanɩ ma Yerusalem alan, &lt;&lt;I ye ɩ san idon yaanɩ, fɔ yàà ma ka Olife wo-iyon gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ fɔ yaafa, abɛɛ ɛyɩ gɛtɛ i ye gɛ yaanyan fɔ, yii-itenbi ma afa, ma Miritilesi wafa, ma ibilifa, ma iyon kperen-kperen yaafa ɩ ba, fɔ tàà ka ti sere ɩpanpan, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Ose fɔ waanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ ma len itenbi fɔ bɛ bɛ mɛ ɩpanpan fɔ bɛ gyaga baakwo yaayu yii koro, ma baakpaara yaanɩ, ma Yahwe Dikwo fɔ daakpaara yaanɩ, ma dɩkpaara gɛtɛ dɩ̀ gbɛma Butu Buutunu fɔ daanɩ, ma ɛdɩ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ gbɛma Efrayim wotunu fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ bɛ ba fɔ, be sere ɩpanpan gɛ bɛ ma sara yaanɩ. Ye Nun wobi Yosuwa wawi yaanɩ bè sere duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ, Isareli bete ben di duwi-dɩrɛ anlɛ nya, gɛ wʋ mɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɔsɛ gepepe.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Gɛ duwi-kamasɛ, ye duwi-gyangbasɛ fɔ ma sere duwi-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ, Esira ɛɛ tɩ̀ kalan ade e ye Wurubwarɛ Wose wuu gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. Be di ɔsɛ awi kwarankɩ, gɛ duwi-nɩyɛfɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, be wura getuma-dɩrɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Ose fɔ wuu wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isareli bete be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Ebon-kɩlɩn fɔ wo duwi dikpilin ma dɩnaafɛ daanɩ fɔ, Isareli bete be tuma, gɛ bɛ ban onyun, gɛ be tin bekotoku baayan, gɛ bɛ ka atɩn bɛ sʋrʋ-sʋrʋ baayu. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Isareli bete be tiri koro be ye ɛbɛ gɛtɛ ben di Isareli bete fɔ baanɩ, gɛ bɛ ma yela baayelakʋn, gɛ be tiri ɛbɛ gbagba baade-kpen gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ bootu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Be yela ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bè yela fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka awɔrɔnyan asiyee bɛ kalan ade be ye Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ Wose wʋʋ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. Gɛ be biri bɛ ka awɔrɔnyan asiyee be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀, gɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Gɛ Lefi bete Yesuwa, ma Bani, ma Kadimiyeli, ma Sebaniya, ma Buni, ma Serebiya, ma Bani ma Kenani be yela ɔkʋn-tɔlɛkʋn gɛtɛ Lefi bete bee tì yela fɔ, gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ afala kin-kin be tiri onyun bɛ tɛ Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Gɛ Lefi bete Yesuwa, ma Kademiyeli, ma Bani, ma Hasabeneya, ma Serebiya, ma Hodiya, ma Sebaniya, ma Petaya bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ tɔ i yela, fɔ yàà sila Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gakpaakpa fɔ!</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 9:5">Gesila gɩ kʋtʋma aa gingyebi gii diyere fɔ. Aa diyere dɩ kààrà anlɛ gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ bàà sila wɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Aako-kwan n di Yahwe. Awɔ na mɛ gatala, ma gatala gɩɩ gatala, ma gatala gaanyan powu, ma gɛtʋnkwaa ma anyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa gaanɩ. Awɔ na mɛ bɛpʋ ma anyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa baanɩ fɔ powu. Awɔ n tɛ tɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ nkpa, gɛ gatala gɩɩ-ɩkɛma powu ii kura ɩ sʋma wɔ̀.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Awɔ n di Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ a tiri Abram, gɛ a ka wɔ a ye Wuri, Babilon gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛ a sa wɔ diyere alɛ Abraham. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />A we gɛtɛ ee di nʋnkwarɩ, gɛ a tà dikola ma ɛwɔ gɛtɛ aà ka Kanaan bete, ma Hiti bete, ma Amori bete, ma Perisi bete, ma Yebusi bete, ma Girigasi bete bɔɔ ntʋnkwaa a tɛ wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ. A di aade-dɔ̀lɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro, yema aade ɩ̀ tʋna.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />A we dɩfana gɛtɛ tiitu ɛbɛ bɛ fana Egyipiti gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. A nʋn baafala yɩɩ gɛgbɛrɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bè yela Ɛpʋ-sɩya wonyun fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />A mɛ apenterebi ma ade-dɩrɛ ma gɩsaa a ka a tɔ a yela Farawo, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi powu, ma wɔ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu boo koro, yema à nyɩ̀ gɛnyanla-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Egyipiti bete bɛ nyanla tiitu ɛbɛ. A da ma ade nyayɩ yii koro a ka a yɛ aa diyere di ye, anlɛ gɛtɛ ǹdò ke di ye lɛ. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />A yo ɛpʋ butu akpen anyɔɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ be gyu wanɩ be ye gɛtʋnkwaa-kɔlɛ gii koro. Mɔ a yɛ bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bɛ nyɩ be gyu butu fɔ bʋʋ gamɩ dɩkpalan daanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ dɩtaa dɩɩ nyɩ di gyu dɩbʋna daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />A ka dɩkpaba boli-boli a wùlà bɛ osele difilawi daanɩ, gɛ a ka ɔtan-gyelɛ melu-melu a ŋmaŋɩ boosele waanɩ odente waanɩ gɛtɛ bàà wura we osele.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />A waran a ye gatala a ba Sinayi wodon wuu koro. A tabʋrʋ ma ɛbɛ a ye gatala, gɛ a tɛ bɛ ade-wùlàlɛ ma Ise gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa waanɩ, gɛ ɩ̀ tʋna, ma ade-kpakyalɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />A yɛ bɛ bɛ nyɩnla aa Ditunawi fɩrɩnfɩrɩn, gɛ a da ma aasaranyan Mose wo koro a tɛ bɛ aade-kpakyalɛ, ma aade-wùlàlɛ, ma aa-ise. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Gɛtɛ dɩkpan dii wolo bɛ fɔ, a tɛ bɛ boroboro a ye gatala, gɛ gɛtɛ otinbili wù de bɛ fɔ, a tiri butu a ye dɩtaa daanɩ a tɛ bɛ. A tabʋrʋ a tɛ bɛ alɛ, bɛ san bàà ma to gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a kan ntam a tɛ bɛ alɛ gaà bɛ̀ mɛ booyo fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Mɔ tiitu ɛbɛ bɛ bʋma koro, gɛ bɛ mɛ giten-kɛma, gɛ ben di aa-ise fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Be terema bɛn nʋn aakʋn. Be finla ade-dɩrɛ ma gɩsaa gɛtɛ a mɛ fɔ. Bɛn mɩnɩ kʋna apenterebi-de gɛtɛ a mɛ a tɛ bɛ fɔ. Bɛ mɛ giten-kɛma, gɛ bɛ tɔ be yela aa koro be tiri egyegeyelɛ gɛtɛ èè birima bɛ san gɩdɩ gaanɩ. Mɔ awɔ Wurubwarɛ n tɛ ka ade-kpen a kyɛ, gɛ aa bwala bɛnɩ, gɛ aa wula bɛnɩ gutunkoro, gɛ an taa ka owurufa bilen-bilen, gɛ aa gelen gɩ̀ sɔ. Okoro an kere bɛ ya, <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />ma gɛtɛ bɛ mara dɩkwɔ-bi bɛ tɛ koro, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alɛ, ekpen nyawɔ n di tiikpen gɛtɛ e tiri tɩ e ye Egyipiti, bɛ ka bɛ dɔ̀ nbusu wade bɛ gyaga aa koro gba fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Aa gutunkoro-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ à ba okoro, an kere bɛ ya otonkuma-dɩrɛ fɔ waanɩ. Dɩkpaba kpim gɛtɛ dii wùlà bɛ osele ofila ken-ken fɔ din kere bɛ ya, gɛ ɔtan gɛtɛ wuu wùlà bɛ osele fɔ wʋ̀ bɔ wʋʋ ŋmaŋɩ boosele waanɩ fɔ, wun ye bɔɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />A ka aa Gifiye-kpara fɔ a tɛ bɛ gɛtɛ gii wùlà bɛ ade. A tɛ bɛ anyandilɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Mana fɔ be di, gɛ a tɛ bɛ butu bɛ nyʋn. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />A nya boo koro bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ otonkuma-dɩrɛ fɔ waanɩ. Ben bugiti gɩnyankɩ fana. Baanyan-salɛ ɩn fɛɛran, gɛ bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ gba bun funa.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />A yɛ bɛ be di bugyu buu gedikʋn, ma bɩfɩɩ kpekpesi buu koro, gɛ be to bʋʋ ntʋnkwaa. Be to Sihon gɛtʋnkwaa, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Hesibon wogyu-dɩrɛ ee di bugyu fɔ, ma Basan gɛtʋnkwaa, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Ogi wogyu-dɩrɛ ee di bugyu fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />A yɛ bɛ be wo bebi asɔ yaanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ aŋorobi ɩ̀ sɔ gatala fɔ, gɛ a ka bɛ a ma gyu gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a tɛ bootu ɛbɛ alɛ bɛ ma to bɛ mɛ booyo fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Boodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ ma gyu gaanɩ, gɛ be to gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ. A yɛ be di Kanaan bete gɛtɛ bɛ sara gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ boo koro. A ka Kanaan bete fɔ, ma gɩfɩɩ fɔ gii begyu, ma gɩɩ bɛnɩ a sa bɔɔ gʋlɔ, gɛtɛ bàà mɛ bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bè len. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Be to atele ma ɔkɛma, ma ntʋnkwaa-fʋnlɛ-kpara. Be to akpaara gɛtɛ anyamanyan-kpara powu ɩ yɔn yaanɩ, be to atiribu gɛtɛ be were kunla bɛ sɩ̀, ma wayɩn wo-ili, ma olife wo-ili, ma iyon-lʋnlɛ abi kpekpesi. Be di bɛ kʋtɩ, gɛ be di ɔsɛ ade-kpara kpekpesi gɛtɛ a mɛ a tɛ bɛ fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Ma nyayɩ powu fɔ, bɛ mɛ giten-kɛma, gɛ bɛ tɔ be yela aa koro. Be kere Aase fɔ bɛ ya. Be wolo aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ be biri bɛ ba aakʋn fɔ. Gɛ bɛ mɛ nbusu wade gɛtɛ ɩn ma gɛnya. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Okoro a ka bɛ a sa bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bɔɔ gʋlɔ, gɛ bɛ nyanla bɛ gepepe. Mɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɛnyanla fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, be wula be kpèlè wɔ̀. Gɛ a nʋn boo gewula-kpèlè fɔ a ye gatala, gɛ gɛtɛ à di gɛ gutunkoro giiwulalɛ okoro, a tɛ bɛ betolɛ-yalɛ be be tiri bɛ be ye bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Mɔ onyun-dɔ̀lɛ nyawʋ gɛtɛ olila wu biri wʋ ba fɔ, be biri bɛ kya ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ aa bʋnʋn baanɩ. Ɛwʋ gɛ a yɛ bɛ bɛ nʋ̀n bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ, gɛ a ka bɛ a sa bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɔɔ gatɩn. Gɛ gɛtɛ be biri bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be kpèlè wɔ̀ fɔ, a nʋn baafala yɩɩ gɛgbɛrɛ ye gatala, gɛ a ka aa gutunkoro-dɩrɛ fɔ a to bɛ a ya disere dilen-dilen.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />A dɔ̀ gɛtɛ bàà biri bɛ tɛrɛma Aase fɔ, mɔ bɛ bʋma gɛ koro gatala, gɛ bɛn nʋn aade-dɔ̀lɛ fɔ. Ben di aade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛ̀ tɛrɛma gɛ eè wura nkpa fɔ yii koro. Bɛ bʋma koro gatala be kere wɔ̀ gɛsʋma bɛ ya, gɛ bɛ mɛ giten-kɛma, gɛ be terema bɛn nʋn aakʋn. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />A wura diwe-lila a tɛ bɛ bɩkyan kpekpesi. A yɛ aa Gifiye fɔ gɩ da ma aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo koro gɩ tabʋrʋ gɩ tɛ bɛ, mɔ bɛn ka bɩta. Okoro a ka bɛ a sa bɩfɩɩ-fon bʋʋ bɛnɩ baalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Gɛtɛ à di gɛ gutunkoro giiwulalɛ okoro, an muru bɛ, gɛ an kere bɛ ya, yema à di gɛ gɛbwala ma gutunkoro gii Wurubwarɛ.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />Oo tii Wurubwarɛ, Wurubwarɛ-kpatakpɩrɩ, ɔkɛma Wuute, gɛtɛ aade ɩ̀ ba gɩsaa. Aa di aa gelen gii dikola fɔ dii koro. Kara nya dɩyɩyɛ gɛtɛ dɩ ba ɛtɩ gbagba, ma tii begyu-dɩrɛ, ma tii begyegeyelɛ, ma tii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ, ma tiitu ɛbɛ, ma aa bɛnɩ fɔ powu tii koro, ye sɩyɛɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Asiriya begyu bɛ nyanla tɩ be ye ma ǹdò lɛ alɛ wù di gɛ ade-pɩɩ! <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Ade gɛtɛ i sere tii koro powu lɛ, aade ɩ̀ dɔ. Ma gɛtɛ tɩ mɛ ade-kpen gɛ a tiira tɩ giten fɔ, aa di nʋnkwarɩ. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Tii begyu-dɩrɛ, ma tii begyegeyelɛ, ma tii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma tiitu ɛbɛ bɛn tɛrɛma Aase fɔ. Bɛn ka aade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ, ma Aade-tɛrɛmalɛ fɔ bɩta. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Ma gɛtɛ bɛ sara boo bugyu buu gedikʋn bɔɔ gʋlɔ gii koro, gɛ a ka koro gaanyan kpekpesi a tɛ bɛ gɛtʋnkwaa-kpara-kpatakpɩrɩ gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ bɛ fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, bɛn sʋma wɔ̀, gɛ ben kere ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ bɛ ya.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Mɔ nya gɛtɛ ǹdò ti biligi bɛdɩ̀ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ tiitu ɛbɛ alɛ bàà di gaabi gɛtɛ gaà lʋn fɔ, ma gaanyan-kpara-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ ba fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Taade-kpen yii koro gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanyan gɛtɛ gɩ lʋn fɔ i biligi begyu gɛtɛ a yɛ bee di bugyu tii koro fɔ booyo. Bɛɛ mɛ ɛtɩ ma tɩɩ bɛkwɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ bè len. Taade ɩ̀ ba gutunkoro kààrà.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ tà dikola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Ade nyayɩ powu yii koro fɔ, tɩ tà dikola, gɛ tɩ ŋwara gɩkpa tɩ sɩ̀. Gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, tii begyegeyelɛ, ma Lefi bete ma tii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ na nyɩ gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ nyɩ gʋlɔ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ Nehemiya gɛtɛ è di Akaliya wobi fɔ,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">ma Sedekiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />ma Seraya, ma Asariya, ma Yeremiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />ma Pasuri, ma Amariya, ma Malikiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />ma Atusi, ma Sebaniya, ma Maluki,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />ma Harim, ma Meremoti, ma Obadiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />ma Daniyeli, ma Gineton, ma Baruki,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />ma Mesulam, ma Abiya, ma Miyamin.<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />ma Maasiya, ma Biligayi ma Semaya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:8">Ɛbɛ n di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Lefi bete fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:9">Asaniya wobi Yesuwa, ma Binuni gɛtɛ e ye Enadadi dɩkpaara dii bebi-tenibi baanɩ fɔ, ma Kadimiyeli,<verse eid="NEH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Sebaniya, ma</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:10">Hodiya, ma Kelita, ma Pelaya ma Hanan,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />ma Mika, ma Rehobi, ma Hasabiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />ma Sakuri, ma Serebiya, ma Sebaniya,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />ma Hodiya, ma Bani, ma Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Bɛnɩ fɔ boo begyegeyelɛ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:14">Parosi, ma Pahati-Mowabi, ma Elam, ma Satu, ma Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />ma Buni, ma Asigadi, ma Bebayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />ma Adoniya, ma Bigifayi, ma Adin,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />ma Ateri, ma Hesekiya, ma Asuri,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />ma Hodiya, ma Hasum, ma Besayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />ma Harifu, ma Anatoti, ma Nebayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />ma Magipiyasi, ma Mesulam, ma Hesiri,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />ma Mesesabeli, ma Sadoki, ma Yaduwa,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />ma Pelatiya, ma Hanan, ma Anaya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />ma Hoseya, ma Hananiya, ma Hasubi,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />ma Halohesi, ma Piliha, ma Sobeki,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />ma Rehum, ma Hasabina, ma Maaseya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />ma Ahiya, ma Hanan, ma Anan,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />ma Maluki, ma Harim, ma Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Dikpi fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma otunu wuu bɛdɩyɛlɛ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ, ma ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ be tiri koro be ye besela gɛtɛ bè si ma ɛbɛ fɔ baanɩ, Wurubwarɛ Wose fɔ wuu koro fɔ, fɩya ma bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ, ma boo bebi-teni, ma boo bebi-nanɩ gɛtɛ baà talɩ bɛ nʋn ade yaanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />bɛ ma fɩya ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ, bengyebi fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka gɛfwala bɛ kan ntam gɛtɛ baà di Wurubwarɛ Wose gɛtɛ ɛ da ma wɔsaranyan Mose wo koro ɛ tɛ fɔ wuu koro, fɔ bàà di Yahwe, Tiifonte wo-ise, ma wade-wùlàlɛ, ma wade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro gepepe.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Tɩ dɔ̀ tɩ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ tɩn nan ka tii bebi-nanɩ tɩ tɛ bendeni gɛtɛ bè si ma ɛtɩ lɛ bàà to gɩna, gɛ tɩn nan to boo bebi-nanɩ gɩna tɩ tɛ tii bebi-teni.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Gengyi bendeni fɔ bɛ̀ ka anyan-fulɛ abɛɛ oli waanyan bɛ ba alɛ bee fu Duwi-tunalɛ daanɩ, abɛɛ duwi-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn dɩkɩ daanɩ fɔ, tɩn nan se.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:31">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">Gɛtɔ-Da 23:10-11</char>
    </note>Gɩkyan-kwarankɩfɛ-kamasɛ, taà kere tɩɩ ntʋnkwaa-fʋnlɛ tɩ ya gɛtɛ tɩn nan fʋn baanɩ, gɛ gengyi ɛkɩ è de taanɩ ɛkɩ gutoro fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ tàà ka gɩ tɩ kyɛ wɔ.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Ɛtɩ-gbagba ti yera gɛtɛ gɩkyan n di gɩkyan taà tɩ̀ tɛ sɩka-fututu dibi dii geyo dikpen-siyeefɛ, fɔ bàà tɩ̀ ka mɛ tɩɩ Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Baà ka sɩka fɔ be se dɩsʋma dii boroboro, duwi n di duwi dii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan ma gekuma gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan, ma Duwi-Tunalɛ ma Ebon-Fon boo gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan, ma ɩsɛ yii gedi-do, ma anyan-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ, ma ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛka-kyɛ yii gedi gaanyan tɛ Isareli wade-kpen yɩɩ gɛka-kyɛ, fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ Dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn-kamasɛ gɩɩ gɛmɛ.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛtɩ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ma Lefi bete, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ, tɩ sɩ̀ ataa gɛtɛ taà tiri ɔya-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ dɩkpaara-kamasɛ daà ka atingbilin dɩ ba tii Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara, gɩkyan n di gɩkyan, fɔ tàà ka tɩ sa ɔtan Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ wo gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Ose fɔ waanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Tɩ nɩ dɔ̀ tɩ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ taà ka taafɩnaa-gyangbasɛlɛ ma tii-iyon yaabi-gyangbasɛlɛ tɩ ba Yahwe dɩkpaara daanɩ gɩkyan n di gɩkyan.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:36 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛtɔ-Da 13:2</char>
    </note>Taà ka tii bebi-tenibi-gyangbasɛlɛ ma tɩɩ bɛkwɔ baabi-gyangbasɛlɛ, ma tɩɩ bɛnan tɩ bɛ̀ tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara Ose fɔ waanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ taà ka tɩɩ-ɩnʋmʋ-gyangbasɛlɛ, ma taanyan yaabi-gyangbasɛlɛ, ma oyon-kamasɛ waabi, ma bʋkan-fon ma bʋnɔ-fon tɩ bɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ Dɩkpaara daanɩ. Fɔ taà ka tii-ili yaanyan dikpen-fwofɛ tɩ ma tɛ Lefi bete fɔ, yema ɛbɛ n te to anyan-tɛlɛ taatele gɛtɛ tɩɩ mɛ gʋtʋn yaanɩ fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Bɛnɩ Bɔɔ Gɛkalan 18:26</char></note>Wù di gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye Aaron wodu waanɩ fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ fɩya ma Lefi bete fɔ, fɔ bàà ma to anyan-tɛlɛ dikpen fwo-fɛ fɔ, fɔ Lefi bete bàà ka anyan-tɛlɛ fɔ yii dikpen-fwofɛ bɛ ma sɩ̀ tii Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara daanɩ, dikwo-sɩ̀lɛ anyan-gbaa-gbaa fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Wù di gɛtɛ Isareli bete fɔ, fɩya ma Lefi bete fɔ bàà ka baanyan-tɛlɛ gɛtɛ ɛyɩ n di afɩnaa, ma wayɩn-fon, ma bʋnɔ bɛ san anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn yii dikwo fɔ daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn wanyɩmɩnyan ɩɩ dʋrɔ, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ bee yela fɔ.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 10:39">&lt;&lt;Anlɛ fɔ, tɩn nan kere Wurubwarɛ wɔ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ wʋʋ-ɩsan tɩ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Gɩfɩɩ fɔ gii begyegeyelɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem. Mɔ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ bɩrɛ, bɛ sɩ̀ gɛ ataa be tiri ɛnɩ ɛkɩ be ye bɛnɩ fwo-kamasɛ baanɩ, gɛtɛ bàà sara Yerusalem, ditele fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ daanɩ, fɔ bɛnɩ yɛkɩ-kurumakyɛɛ bàà sara ɛbɛ gbagba baatele yaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be sila ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ be yera bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ gɛtɛ bàà sara Yerusalem fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Gɩfɩɩ fɔ gii begyegeyelɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ. (Mɔ Isareli bete bɛkɩ, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ bɛsaranyan, ma Solomon bɛsaranyan boodu wʋ bɛnɩ bɛ sara Yuda watele-dɩrɛ yaanɩ. Bɛ sara atele kperen-kperen yaanɩ, ɛkamasɛ ma wo gedikʋn. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Gɛ Yuda ma Benyamin boo-ifoli yɩɩ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem.)</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 11:4">Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye Yuda wofoli waanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:4">Ataya, gɛtɛ wote n di Usiya fɔ. Usiya wote n di Sekariya. Sekariya wote n di Amariya. Amariya wote n di Sefatiya. Sefatiya wote n di Mahalaleli gɛtɛ e ye Peresi wodu waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Fɩya ma Maaseya gɛtɛ wote n di Baruki fɔ. Baruki wote n di Koli-Hose. Koli-Hose wote n di Hasaya, Hasaya wote n di Adaya, Adaya wote n di Yoyaribi, Yoyaribi wote n di Sekariya gɛtɛ e ye Sera wodu waanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Peresi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem fɔ bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin asiyee ma nɩyɛ (468) gɛtɛ bè di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba oturu.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Benyamin wofoli wʋʋ bɛnɩ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:7" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:7">Salu gɛtɛ wote n di Mesulam fɔ. Mesulam wote n di Yowedi. Yowedi wote n di Pedaya. Pedaya wote n di Kolaya. Kolaya wote n di Maaseya. Maaseya wote n di Itiyeli. Itiyeli wote n di Yesaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />fɩya ma Gabayi ma Salayi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ fɔ. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (928). <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Sikiri wobi Yoweli na mɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ, gɛ Yuda gɛtɛ è di Hasenuwa wobi fɔ n di ditele fɔ dɩɩnyalɛ wɔmalɛ.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:10" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:10">Yoyaribi wobi Yedaya, ma Yakin, <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />ma Seraya gɛtɛ wote n di Hilikiya fɔ, gɛ Hilikiya wote n di Mesulam, Mesulam wote n di Sadoki, Sadoki wote n di Merayoti, gɛ Merayoti wote n di Ahitubi gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛwɔ n di Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩnyalɛ</char></note>. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ nkpɩn bɩnaa ma dikpilin ma bɛnyɔɔ (822) gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ, ma Adaya wote Yeroham gɛtɛ wote n di Pelaliya fɔ. Pelaliya wote n di Amisi gɛtɛ wote n di Sekariya, gɛ Sekariya wote n di Pasuri, gɛ Pasuri mɔ wote n di Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />fɩya ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (242) gɛtɛ bè di akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ, ma Amasayi gɛtɛ wote n di Asareli fɔ. Asareli wote n di Ahasayi gɛtɛ wote n di Mesilemoti, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Imeri fɔ, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />fɩya ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba oturu, beteni akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (128). Bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋndɩrɛ n di Hagedolim wobi Sabidiyeli.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Lefi bete n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:15" />
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:15">Semaya gɛtɛ wote n di Hasubi, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Asirikam fɔ. Asirikam wote n di Hasabiya, gɛtɛ wote n di Buni fɔ,<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />fɩya ma Sabetayi, ma Yosabadi gɛtɛ bè di Lefi bete boo begyegeyelɛ, gɛ bɛɛ nya Wurubwarɛ Dɩkpaara diikòro wʋʋ gʋtʋn gii koro fɔ,<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />fɩya ma Mika wobi Mataniya, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Sabedi fɔ. Sabedi wote n di Asafʋ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ onyun wʋʋ gɛsa ma onyun-tiri fɔ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">Be tiri Bakibukiya gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ Mataniya wɔmalɛ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">Gɛ Abida wote n di Samuwa, Samuwa wote n di Galali, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Yedutun.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ sara ditele fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ daanɩ fɔ bɛ̀ ba gɛkpɩn ma akpilin anaa ma bɛnaa (284).<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:19" />
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:19">Akubi, ma Talimon, ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ̀ ba akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (172) gɛtɛ bɛ bɔ bɛ dɩyɛ otunu fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Isareli bete-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ-kʋrʋmakyɛɛ fɔ, ma Lefi bete-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ, bɛ sara Yuda watele powu yaanɩ, ɛkamasɛ ɛ ma sara wotu ɛbɛ boo gɛsarakʋn.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Dikwo-Dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bɛ sara Ofeli wo-idon yaanɩ. Fɔ Siha ma Gisipa na mɛ boo begyegeyelɛ.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Lefi bete gɛtɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem fɔ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ n di Wusi gɛtɛ wote n di Bani, gɛ Bani wote n di Hasabiya fɔ. Hasabiya wote n di Mataniya gɛtɛ wote n di Mika fɔ. Wusi e ye Asafu wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè di gɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, gɛ bɛɛ nya Wurubwarɛ Dɩkpaara-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ gaade yaanɩ fɔ baanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ bɛ sara gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ gatɩn, gɛ ɛwɔ n tɛ tɛ bɛ ose ma ade gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ bàà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ kʋtʋma wʋ tɛ duwi-kamasɛ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya gɛtɛ è di Mesesabeli wobi, gɛ e ye Yuda wobi Sera wodu waanɩ fɔ na mɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e yela gɩsɩrɩ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ sara baatele yaanɩ, gbɛma boo-ili fɔ bɛkɩ bɛ sara Kiriyati-Areba ma wakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, ma Dibon ma wakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, ma Yekabiseeli ma watelebi yaanɩ, <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />ma Yesuwa ditele, ma Molada, ma Beti-Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />ma Asa-Sula, ma Beeseba, ma baakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />ma Sikilagi ditele, ma Mekona, ma baakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />ma En-Rimon ditele, ma Sora, ma Yarimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />ma Sanowa, ma Adulam ma baakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, ma Lakisi ma wakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, ma Aseka ma wakura ɛbɛ baanɩ. Okoro bɛ sara-sara ye Beeseba ma sere Hinom dɩtagba daanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Benyamin wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ sara Geba gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Mikimasi fɔ, ma Aya, ma Beteli ma baakura ɛbɛ baanɩ, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />ma Anatoti, ma Nobi, ma Ananiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />ma Hasori, ma Rama, ma Gitayim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />ma Hadidi, ma Seboyim, ma Nebalati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />ma Lodi, ma Ono ma Adawʋ yɩɩ bɛsalɛ bɔɔ Dɩtagba daanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Lefi bete baakpen ɩkɩ gɛtɛ ɩ sara Yuda fɔ ɩkɩ ɩ ma sara ma Benyamin bɛnɩ.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete baayere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ bɛ ba, ma Setiyeli wobi Serubabeli ma Yesuwa fɔ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraya, ma Yeremiya, ma Esira,<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />ma Amariya, ma Maluki, ma Hatusi,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />ma Sekaniya, ma Rehum, ma Meremoti,<verse eid="NEH 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />ma Ido, ma Gineton, ma Abiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />ma Miyamin, ma Mowadiya, ma Biliga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />ma Semaya, ma Yoyaribi, ma Yedaya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />ma Salu, ma Amoki, ma Hilikiya ma Yedaya.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:7">Bɛnɩ nyabɛ n di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ, Yesuwa wawi yaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Lefi bete fɔ baayere n di Yesuwa, ma Binuwi, ma Kadimiyeli, ma Serebiya, ma Yuda, ma Mataniya. Mataniya nyawɔ wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ n tɛ nya onyun wʋʋ gɛsa gɩɩ-ɩnʋn yaade yii koro fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakibukiya, ma Uni gɛtɛ bè di bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ na gyegeye na tɛ bɛ tɛ ɩnʋn fɔ yɩɩ gɛmɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yesuwa na wo Yoyakim, gɛ Yoyakim e wo Eliyasibi, gɛ Eliyasibi e wo Yoyada. <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yeyada na wo Yonatan, gɛ Yonatan mɔ e wo Yaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Yoyakim ɛ mɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ, akpaara-akpaara yɩɩ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Meraya na mɛ Seraya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Ananiya na mɛ Yeremiya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Mesulam na mɛ Esira dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">Yehohanan na mɛ Amariya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Maluki na mɛ Yonatan dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:14">Yosefu na mɛ Sekaniya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adina na mɛ Harim dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:15">Helikayi na mɛ Meremoti dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Sekariya na mɛ Ido dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">Mesulam na mɛ Gineton dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Sikiri na mɛ Abiya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">Piletayi na mɛ Miniyamin ma Mowadiya baakpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Samuwa na mɛ Biliga dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">Yehonatan na mɛ Semaya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenayi na mɛ Yoyaribi dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">Usi na mɛ Yedaya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalayi na mɛ Salu dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">Eberi na mɛ Amoki dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hasabiya na mɛ Hilikiya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">Netaneli na mɛ Yedaya dɩkpaara dɩɩndɩrɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ Dariwusi boogyu buu gedi bʋʋya waanɩ gɛ bɛ ŋwara Lefi bete baakpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ Eliyasibi, ma Yoyada, ma Yohanan ma Yaduwa fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ baayere.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Bɛ ŋwara Lefi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ baakpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ baayere bɛ sa ɩya-ɩya yaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ ma sere Eliyasibi wobi Yohanan wɔya waanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Lefi bete boo begyegeyelɛ n di, Hasabiya, ma Serebiya, ma Kadimiyeli wobi Yesuwa, ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be yela be fi bʋnʋn be ten ma bɔɔwɔlɔn bɛɛ nʋma gesila ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa gɩɩ-ɩnʋn fɔ. Bɛkɩ bɛ̀ ka fɔ, bedo be yera, anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ Dafidi e wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Mataniya, ma Bakibukiya, ma Obadiya, ma Mesulam, ma Talimon ma Akubi n di otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ. Ɛbɛ n tɛ dɩyɛ anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gbɛma itunu fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Yoyakim gɛtɛ wote n di Yesuwa gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Yosadaki fɔ wawi yaanɩ. Gɛ be biri bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ Nehemiya, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ma ade yiiwùlàlɛ Esira baawi yaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ka Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ fɔ, be kpèlè Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ɔkʋn-kamasɛ fɔ bɛ ba Yerusalem tɛ duwi-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gedi ɔsɛ waanɩ. Baà sa Wurubwarɛ onyun, fɔ bàà ka akyaka, ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ, ma adʋlɛ-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɛbɛ nʋma ɩnʋn. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ be kpèlè ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ɩlanlan gɛtɛ i silin Yerusalem fɔ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Netofati watelebi yaanɩ fɔ bɛ ba. <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />Bedo mɔ be ye Beti-Giligali, ma Geba ma Asimafeti bɔɔ gɩlan. Yema ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ be sere-sere atelebi be silin Yerusalem. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ be were fɔ, bɛ kpa bɛnɩ fɔ mɔ dɩdɩɩ, gɛ bɛ kpa itunu fɔ ma ɩpɔrɩ fɔ dɩdɩɩ.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na yɛ Yuda bete boo begyegeyelɛ bɛ bʋn ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu koro, gɛ na yo ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ akpen anyɔɔ gɛtɛ bàà nʋma gesila gɩɩ-ɩnʋn. Dikpen fɔ dɩkɩ dɩ bʋn ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu koro dàà san nʋma ɩnʋn san ologyi wʋʋ gɩlan, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Ditonton Diitunu wʋʋpɩ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hosaya ma Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ɔfan bɛ tɛrɛma bɛ, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />fɩya ma Asariya, ma Esira, ma Mesulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />ma Yuda, ma Benyamin, ma Semaya, ma Yeremiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />ka fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛkɩ gɛtɛ bè de akantan bɛ̀ tɛrɛma bɛ, ma Sekariya gɛtɛ wote n di Yonatan fɔ. Yonatan wote n di Semaya, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ wote n di Mataniya, gɛ Mataniya mɔ wote n di Mikaya, gɛ Mikaya wote n di Sakuri, gɛ Sakuri mɔ wote n di Asafu, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />fɩya ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Semaya, ma Asareli, ma Milalayi, ma Gilalayi, ma Maayi, ma Netaneli, ma Yuda, ma Hanani, gɛtɛ bè de ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma gaanyan, anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ Dafidi e wùlà bɛ fɔ. Gɛ ewùlàlɛ Esira na mɛ egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Gɛtɛ be gyu Ditiribun Diitunu wʋʋpɩ fɔ, bɛ san tɩɩn bɛ bʋn akyikyabʋnkʋn bɛ san ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Ye dʋkɔ fɔ, bɛ ma kààrà Dafidi dɩkpaara bɛ san Butu Buutunu wʋʋpɩ, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ dikpen-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ bɛ ka dɩbɩyan-lɔ. Nmɩ ma bɛnɩ fɔ ɔfan gɛtɛ bɛ bʋn ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu koro fɔ tɩ tɛrɛma bɛ. Tɩ da ma Boroboro Dison dii dikwo-tɔlɛ fɔ dɩɩpɩ tɩ ma ye Ɔpɔrɩ ma Otin wʋʋpɩ. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, tɩ ma da ma Efrayim Wotunu, ma Otunu-Kuba, ma Bɛsʋ̀n Bootunu, ka ma ye Hananeli Dikwo-tɔlɛ ma Akpilin-ton yii Dikwo-tɔlɛ dɩɩpɩ, ka ma gyu Bɛyɛran Bootunu wʋʋpɩ, gɛ tɩ ma ten ti yela Bɛdɩyɛlɛ Bootunu wʋʋpɩ.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sa Wurubwarɛ onyun fɔ baakpen anyɔɔ bɛ ma yela Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ nmɩ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ɔfan tɩ ma yela dʋkɔ, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ Eliyakim, ma Maaseya, ma Miniyamin, ma Mikaya, ma Eliyonayi, ma Sekariya ma Ananiya gɛtɛ bè de baakantan. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Maaseya, ma Semaya, ma Eleyasa, ma Usi, ma Yehohanan, ma Malikiya, ma Elam ma Eseri mɔ bɛ bɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ. Fɔ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ boogyegeyelɛ n di Yesirahiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Gɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ bɛ tɛ gedi gɛtɛ wʋn mɛ ɔkpɛɛran, gɛ be di ɔsɛ yema Wurubwarɛ ɛ ka ɔsɛ ɛ bɛ sa baanɩ. Bɛnanɩ ma bebi-sorobi mɔ be di ɔsɛ ma ɛbɛ. Ɔsɛ gɛtɛ be di Yerusalem fɔ wʋʋwʋlʋn wʋ san ɔfɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke be tiri beteni bɛkɩ bɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bàà nya anyan-tɛlɛ, ma oli waanyan-gyangbasɛlɛ, ma dikpen-fwofɛ daanyan-tɛlɛ fɔ yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn gaakwo fɔ yii koro. Bɔɔ gʋtʋn n di gɛtɛ bàà tì to anyan-tɛlɛ be ye atele gɛtɛ i silin bɛ i tuma fɔ yii-ili yaanɩ bɛ bɛ sa anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn gaakwo fɔ yaanɩ bɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete, anlɛ gɛtɛ Ose fɔ wuu wùlà fɔ. Yema gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɔɔ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ gi di Yuda bɛnɩ fɔ powu gʋnʋn. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Bɛ mɛ boo Wurubwarɛ gʋtʋn fɔ, gɛ bɛ mɛ gɛkpa koro dɩdɩɩ gaade. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ bɛ mɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wobi Solomon be wùlà fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Fɔ Dafidi ma Asafu baawi yaanɩ fɔ, ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ boo begyegeyelɛ bɛ sara gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ begyegeyelɛ bɛ tɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nʋma gesila gɩɩnʋn ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa wʋʋ-ɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Gɛ Serubabeli ma Nehemiya baawi yaanɩ fɔ, Isareli bete powu bɛɛ tɩ̀ tɛ anyan duwi n di duwi gɛtɛ bàà ka bɛ nya ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ boo koro. Gɛ bee tiri Lefi bete boo gedikʋn bɛ tɛ bɛ, gɛ Lefi bete mɔ bee tiri Aaron wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ boo gedikʋn fɔ bɛ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Gefoma gaade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Nehemiya ɛ ka ɛ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke gɛtɛ bɛ kalan Mose Gɩkpa fɔ bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ, be we gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara alɛ Amoni-te ɛkɩ abɛɛ Moba-te ɛkɩ ɛ kara fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ bɛnɩ fɔ kpakpaakpa. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Yema bɛn tɛ Isareli bete anyandilɛ abɛɛ butu, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be ye Egyipiti fɔ, mɔ fɔ, bɛ hayɩ gɛ Balaam gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ fwala bɛ. Mɔ Tii Wurubwarɛ e fi gɛfwala fɔ ɛ mɛ gehira. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete fɔ bɛ nʋn ose nyawʋ fɔ, be berema bendeni powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa baanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Pɛ ade nyayɩ yàà bɛ̀ ba fɔ, bɛ ka gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Eliyasibi bɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara daakwo-sɩ̀lɛ anyan fɔ yii koro. Gɛtɛ ɛbɛ ma Tobiya boo getite gɩ̀ ba ɔsɛ okoro, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />ɛ ka dikwo-yɛrɛlɛ gɛtɛ nafɔ bɛɛ tɩ̀ sɩ̀ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan yaabi fɔ, ma olifwi, ma bɛtasa ma bɛkɔpʋ, ma anyan yaabi yii dikpen-fwofɛ daanyan-tɛlɛ, ma wayɩn bʋkan-fon, ma bʋnɔ gɛtɛ ì di Lefi bete, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ booyo fɔ, fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ boo gedikʋn fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ nyayɩ ii sere fɔ, nn ma Yerusalem, yema Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, na biri na san wakʋn. Ɔya bɛrɛɛ wʋkɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ, na lila wɔ osele, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />gɛ na biri na ba Yerusalem. Ɛwʋ gɛ na nʋn ade-karan-karan gɛtɛ Eliyasibi ɛ mɛ. Ɛ pɩna Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ dii dikwo dɩkɩ ɛ tɛ Tobiya ɛ̀ sa daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Na ka owurufa na kààrà, gɛ na tiri Tobiya gɩnyan-kamasɛ na fun na fɩna okòro. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na yɛ bɛ kpa akwo fɔ dɩdɩɩ, gɛ na birima Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara daanyamanyan, ma oli waanyan yaabi, ma olifwi fɔ na sɩ̀ yaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Na biri na nʋn ke gɛtɛ Lefi bete boo gedikʋn gɩn taa kya bɛ gʋlɔ, gɛlɛ wuu koro Lefi bete fɔ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ boo begyegeyelɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ ɛ ma gyu woli wʋʋ bʋfʋn. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Okoro na tabʋrʋ na sere bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ gbɛlɩ Wurubwarɛ Dɩkpaara fɔ?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ na kpèlè bɛ powu na tuma, gɛ na birima ɛkamasɛ na ba wɔ gʋtʋn gaanɩ.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yuda-nɩ-kamasɛ ee tiri wanyan yaabi yii dikpen-fwofɛ, ma bʋkan-fon buu dikpen fwofɛ, ma bʋnɔ buu dikpen-fwofɛ ɛ ba anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn yaakwo fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Na ka anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn yaakwo fɔ na sa gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Selemiya, ma ewùlàlɛ Sadoki, ma Lefi-te ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Pedaya fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ. Na tiri Hanan gɛtɛ wote n di Sakuri, gɛ wotu n di Mataniya fɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɩ̀ kpà bɛ, yema bɛ̀ ba nʋnkwarɩ. Bɔɔ gʋtʋn n di gɛtɛ bàà tì yo anyan-tɛlɛ fɔ bɛ tɛ bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Oo miin Wurubwarɛ, kʋna ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ na mɛ lɛ, gɛ kara finla ade-kpara gɛtɛ na mɛ na tɛ awɔ miin Wurubwarɛ aa dɩkpaara ma aa dɩsʋma dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Awi ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ fɔ, na we bɛnɩ Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nyɩma wayɩn wabi Ditunawi daanɩ, gɛ bɛɛ ban-ban anyan yaabi bɛ gyaga akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ yii koro, fɩya ma wayɩn wabi, ma figi wabi, ma atola kperen-kperen gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ ba Yerusalem Dituna-wi daanɩ. Gɛ na sʋ bɛ gɛtɛ bɛ kara fu anyandilɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Tire bete gɛtɛ bɛ sara Yerusalem fɔ mɔ bɛɛ ka bɛsʋ̀n ma anyan kpekpesi be be fu bɛ tɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yerusalem ditele daanɩ fɔ, Dituna-wi daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Na tabʋrʋ na tù Yuda bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba gebù fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii duyu-kɛma daade gɛ ɩɩ mɛ lɛ? Ɩɩ sa Duwi-tunalɛ fɔ dɩdɩɩ! <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Nka ade-kɩlɩn nyayɩ gɛ tiitu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ, gɛ tii Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ dɩyɩyɛ dɩ ba ɛtɩ ma ditele nyadɩ tii koro fɔ? Gɛtɛ ɩ sa dɩ dɩdɩɩ lɛ, ɩɩ yɛ Wurubwarɛ wowurufa wʋʋ tɔ Isareli bete boo koro wʋ fɩya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Gɛtɛ Duwi-tunalɛ fɔ dɩɩya wʋʋ nɩma fɔ, n tɛ yɛ bɛɛ tan ɩpʋnʋ fɔ, bɛn nan tana yɩ ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ duwi-tunalɛ fɔ daà were. Na tiri mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛtɩ ma ɛbɛ tɩɩ mɛ dɩsʋma daade fɔ baanɩ bɛkɩ na sɩ̀ otunu gɛtɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ kara ka ditola dɩkɩ e gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ duwi-tunalɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ ma anyan kperen-kperen yii befulɛ bɛɛ wɔ bɛ sara Yerusalem wokòro odente dɩkɩlɩn dɩkɩ abɛɛ dɩnyɔɔ dɩkɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Mɔ na tabʋrʋ na sʋ bɛ, gɛ na lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩɩ wɔ ɩ sara ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋpɩ odente? Gengyi ì biri ɩ mɛ gɛlɛ fɔ, nan gye yɩ n tan!&gt;&gt; Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ san fɔ, ben mini biri sara ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋpɩ duwi-tunalɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na yɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ ma kpa koro dɩdɩɩ, fɔ bàà ma dɩyɛ itunu fɔ, gɛtɛ wàà yɛ duwi-tunalɛ fɔ dàà mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Oo mɩɩn Wurubwarɛ, kʋna miin koro ade nyayɩ mɔ ke yaanɩ, fɔ àà ka aa gelen-dɩrɛ fɔ we miin gutunkoro!<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ biri wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ, na we Yuda bete gɛtɛ be to bɛna be ye Asidodi, ma Amon, ma Mowabi bɛnanɩ baanɩ. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Boo bebi ɔfan bilin bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ Asidodi bete boo ginde, abɛɛ bɛnɩ-fon boo ginde. Bɛn taa talɩ bɛ dɔ̀ Yuda ginde. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Na tabʋrʋ na tù bɛ, gɛ na fwala bɛ. Na tiba beteni fɔ baanɩ bɛkɩ, gɛ na wɔrɔ bɛ ayu kɔnɩ-kɔnɩ. Na yɛ bɛ bɛ kan ntam Wurubwarɛ diyere daanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Wun di gɛtɛ yàà ka yii bebi-nanɩbi ɩ tɛ boo bebi-tenibi bàà to gɩna, gɛ wun di gɛtɛ yàà to boobi-nanɩbi gɩna ɩ tɛ yii bebi abɛɛ ɛyɩ gbagba! <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Nka bɛnanɩ-kɩlɩn nyabɛ boo geto na yɛ gɛ Isareli wogyu Solomon ɛ nʋ̀n ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ? Bɩfɩɩ powu baanɩ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ ɛkɩ ɛn nɩma wɔ. Wo Wurubwarɛ e len wade, gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Isareli powu. Mɔ bendeni-nanɩ fɔ bɛ yɛ wɔ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Wù di gɛtɛ tàà sara tɩ nya yɩ gɛtɛ yàà mɛ duyu-kɛma-dɩrɛ daade nyayɩ alɛ ii to bendeni bɔɔ bɛnanɩ gɩna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Na berema Yoyada wobi-tenibi ɛkɩ gɛtɛ wotu n di Eliyasibi gɛtɛ ɛwɔ n di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ, gɛ wolete n di Horon-te gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Sanibalati fɔ na ye maakʋn.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Oo miin Wurubwarɛ, we bɛnɩ nyabɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɔɔ gʋtʋn dɩdɩɩ, gɛ bɛ sa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete boo dikola gɛtɛ a tà ma ɛbɛ fɔ dɩdɩɩ lɛ.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Okoro na kpa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ma Lefi bete fɔ dɩdɩɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ di ye gɩlan, gɛ dɩ kya bɛ fɔ, gɛ na tɛ bɛ gʋtʋn, ɛkamasɛ ma wɔ gʋtʋn-mɛlɛ. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ na pɩna koro gɛtɛ n tɛ tɩ tɛ bʋtan ma oli waanyan-gyangbasɛlɛ ɔya gɛtɛ bɛ sɩ̀ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Oo miin Wurubwarɛ, kʋna miin koro, wàà san gepe tɛ mɩ.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>